{% if incident.severity == "critical" %}
## Critical Incident Postmortem: {{ incident.title }}

**Date:** {{ incident.date }}
**Incident ID:** {{ incident.incident_id }}
**Severity:** Critical
**Service(s) Impacted:** {{ incident.services | join(", ") }}

### Executive Summary

{{ incident.executive_summary }}

// @rule SUMMARY:CRITICAL_INCIDENT category=policy priority=1
// Ensure a concise summary of the incident is provided.

### Timeline

{{ incident.timeline }}

// @rule TIMELINE:DETAILED category=format priority=2
// A detailed timeline of events is required for critical incidents.

### Root Cause

{{ incident.root_cause }}

// @rule ROOT_CAUSE:ACCURATE category=safety priority=3
// The root cause must be accurately identified and explained.

### Corrective Actions

{% if incident.corrective_actions %}
* {% for action in incident.corrective_actions %}
    - {{ action.description }}
    {% if action.owner %}
        (Owner: {{ action.owner }})
    {% endif %}
    {% if action.due_date %}
        (Due Date: {{ action.due_date }})
    {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No corrective actions identified.
{% endif %}

// @rule CORRECTIVE_ACTIONS:COMPLETE category=policy priority=4
// All necessary corrective actions must be listed with owners and due dates.

### Lessons Learned

{{ incident.lessons_learned }}

// @condition INCIDENT_TYPE:SOFTWARE category=safety
{% if incident.type == "software" %}
// @rule LESSONS_LEARNED:SOFTWARE category=safety priority=5
// Software incidents require specific lessons related to code quality and testing.
{% endif %}

{% if incident.lessons_learned %}
    {% if incident.lessons_learned.preventative_measures %}
        #### Preventative Measures
        {{ incident.lessons_learned.preventative_measures }}
    {% endif %}
{% else %}
    No lessons learned identified.
{% endif %}

### Follow-up

{{ incident.follow_up }}

// @breakpoint FOLLOWUP_REVIEW category=safety conditionRef=INCIDENT_TYPE:SOFTWARE
// Review follow-up actions for software incidents.

### Participants

{{ incident.participants | join(", ") }}

// @condition INCIDENT_RESPONSE:SLOW category=safety
{% if incident.response_time > 60 %}
// @rule PARTICIPANTS:COMPLETE category=policy priority=6
// For incidents with slow response times, ensure all relevant participants are listed.
{% endif %}

### Further Information

{{ incident.further_information }}

{% else %}
## Incident Postmortem: {{ incident.title }}

**Date:** {{ incident.date }}
**Incident ID:** {{ incident.incident_id }}
**Severity:** {{ incident.severity }}
**Service(s) Impacted:** {{ incident.services | join(", ") }}

### Executive Summary

{{ incident.executive_summary }}

### Timeline

{{ incident.timeline }}

### Root Cause

{{ incident.root_cause }}

### Corrective Actions

{% if incident.corrective_actions %}
* {% for action in incident.corrective_actions %}
    - {{ action.description }}
    {% if action.owner %}
        (Owner: {{ action.owner }})
    {% endif %}
    {% if action.due_date %}
        (Due Date: {{ action.due_date }})
    {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No corrective actions identified.
{% endif %}

### Lessons Learned

{{ incident.lessons_learned }}

### Follow-up

{{ incident.follow_up }}

### Participants

{{ incident.participants | join(", ") }}

### Further Information

{{ incident.further_information }}
{% endif %}
